[00:20.92]We praise you, Jehovah, deep from our hearts,
[00:27.18]For in your Word we find
[00:32.63]Your power supreme, your wisdom so great,
[00:41.36]And yet you are loving and kind.
[00:48.16]Your Son still invites those bruised by the world
[00:54.76]To leave their cares behind.
[01:00.67]How kindly his yoke, how tender his heart,
[01:08.80]He’s always refreshing and kind.
[01:43.16]We see in our God and Jesus our Lord,
[01:49.48]The persons we should be.
[01:56.76]The power of kindness we can possess.
[02:03.62]With kindness, how strong we can be!
